<title>USA: Etec sees shipments delayed.</title>
<headline>Etec sees shipments delayed.</headline>
<dateline>HAYWORD, Calif. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Etec Systems Inc said that one and possibly more systems originally scheduled for shipment during the first quarter ended November 1 would be delayed into the second quarter.</p>
<p>It said one shipment of MEBES 4500 system sheduled for the first quarter was delayed. The U.S. list price for that system is $7.3 million.</p>
<p>As a result, it said it expects revenue in the first quarter of 1997 to be in the range of $43 to $45 million.</p>
<p>In the year-ago first quarter, the company reported total revenues of $24.7 million.</p>
</text>
